= Navigation =

BITwiki navigation should support both deliberate study and exploratory traversal across a semantic knowledge graph.

== Navigation surfaces ==

=== Main Page ===
The public entry point and concise orientation surface.

=== Portals ===
High-level entry points into major knowledge fields and coherent knowledge surfaces. Historical Book Matter work described portals as '''intelligent entry points to recursive knowledge networks'''.

* [[Portal:Systems science]] — foundational/root orientation
* [[Portal:Science]]
* [[Portal:Biology]]
* [[Portal:Computer science]]
